(7512560, 1199306, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC Roger and what a great start! Good focus and DOF to bring out the important detail together with good colour and lighting makes this work very well. You already have a great set of images in your submissions, we look forward to more great entries from you.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Welcome to DPC Roger and what a great start! Good focus and DOF to bring out the important detail together with good colour and lighting makes this work very well. You already have a great set of images in your submissions, we look forward to more great entries from you.', '2017-05-08 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512561, 1199352, 138630, '<td valign="top">9 from me - it certainly would have made my front page.  Beautiful.</td>', '9 from me - it certainly would have made my front page.  Beautiful.', '2017-05-08 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512562, 1198554, 138630, '<td valign="top">Really tough shot!  I love the color and light and I think the focus is exceptional.</td>', 'Really tough shot!  I love the color and light and I think the focus is exceptional.', '2017-05-08 11:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512563, 1199048, 138630, '<td valign="top">So peaceful - gorgeous lighting and I just love the simple scene.</td>', 'So peaceful - gorgeous lighting and I just love the simple scene.', '2017-05-08 11:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512567, 1199309, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Your image and title emphasises the beauty and importance of good light to photography. Your blend of exposures gives a HDR effect that enables you to show the scene in all its glory. Though I am not a fan of this technique, I feel its results are generally too artificial, you have created a strong visual impact, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Your image and title emphasises the beauty and importance of good light to photography. Your blend of exposures gives a HDR effect that enables you to show the scene in all its glory. Though I am not a fan of this technique, I feel its results are generally too artificial, you have created a strong visual impact, well done.', '2017-05-08 11:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512568, 1198897, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>I really like this though evidently the voters didnt seem to rate it as highly as it deserved. There is a great dynamic to the image, together with the strong colours it has huge visual impact. The composition is good, the image has a very vibrant feel, a very creative result well done Nikki.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge I really like this though evidently the voters didnt seem to rate it as highly as it deserved. There is a great dynamic to the image, together with the strong colours it has huge visual impact. The composition is good, the image has a very vibrant feel, a very creative result well done Nikki.', '2017-05-08 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512569, 1199386, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Youve made great use of that huge lens Drake! As your commenters have already stated there is a huge amount of detail, looking at your details a bright night too! The cropping emphasises the crater you refer to well, sorry I cant help with any additional info my moon mapping knowledge is non-existant.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Youve made great use of that huge lens Drake! As your commenters have already stated there is a huge amount of detail, looking at your details a bright night too! The cropping emphasises the crater you refer to well, sorry I cant help with any additional info my moon mapping knowledge is non-existant.', '2017-05-08 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512570, 1199279, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>As I scrolled down this image you were the last person I expected this entry from, as you say, this is  not your normal genre. Youve made a great job of it Ronnie, the strong colours are a very dynamic backdrop to your very attractive model. I like the rim lighting effect on your model. The whole result is different and appealing it works well.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge As I scrolled down this image you were the last person I expected this entry from, as you say, this is  not your normal genre. Youve made a great job of it Ronnie, the strong colours are a very dynamic backdrop to your very attractive model. I like the rim lighting effect on your model. The whole result is different and appealing it works well.', '2017-05-08 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512571, 1199028, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>May I also add my congratulations Gin Tay, a great result for a great image. What a fascinating place and what a great way to present it. Your composition really emphasises the crowded space reaching up to the freedom of the open skies above. A great mix of colours adds to the interest of the image as a whole. Im intrigued by the coloured brolly(?) at the top of the lower right of the building. A thoroughly well earned ribbon, thanks for your submission.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge May I also add my congratulations Gin Tay, a great result for a great image. What a fascinating place and what a great way to present it. Your composition really emphasises the crowded space reaching up to the freedom of the open skies above. A great mix of colours adds to the interest of the image as a whole. Im intrigued by the coloured brolly(?) at the top of the lower right of the building. A thoroughly well earned ribbon, thanks for your submission.', '2017-05-08 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512572, 1198994, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>What an amazing bird Janine, Im intrigued to know what it is, presumably an owl of some sort? This is quite different from your normal entry a refreshing and effective portrait. Those eyes are incredible!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge What an amazing bird Janine, Im intrigued to know what it is, presumably an owl of some sort? This is quite different from your normal entry a refreshing and effective portrait. Those eyes are incredible!', '2017-05-08 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512574, 1199185, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Thank you for your explanation it saved me some head scratching! A very creative idea that you have captured well, I love the distortions that the water has created it gives the whole image a new dynamic that works really well</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Thank you for your explanation it saved me some head scratching! A very creative idea that you have captured well, I love the distortions that the water has created it gives the whole image a new dynamic that works really well', '2017-05-08 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512576, 1199402, 19825, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nicely done, Nikki. Outstanding image.</td>', 'Wow. Nicely done, Nikki. Outstanding image.', '2017-05-08 11:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512577, 1199181, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>The motion blur works really well here, I like it. What also makes it work so well is your timing with the small aperture to create that dynamic starburst effect in exactly the right place. The balance of the runner and the lighthouse is good, even the exaggerated swing of the arms also creates a further dynamic all finished off nicely with that huge grin it results in an original and appealing image, well done Yao.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge The motion blur works really well here, I like it. What also makes it work so well is your timing with the small aperture to create that dynamic starburst effect in exactly the right place. The balance of the runner and the lighthouse is good, even the exaggerated swing of the arms also creates a further dynamic all finished off nicely with that huge grin it results in an original and appealing image, well done Yao.', '2017-05-08 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512583, 1199250, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> It has every promise to be a great shot and yet, there is too much unessential background for a shot that is not candid<br/>bump </i></td></tr></table> <br/>but it tells a story</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: It has every promise to be a great shot and yet, there is too much unessential background for a shot that is not candidbump  but it tells a story', '2017-05-08 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
